{"type":"text","timestamp":1787345894611,"sessionID":"ses_fda1daed3ffeZ76o2z0rrfeMgg","part":{"id":"prt_0261ddaee001wq2XUK1XqW37Ew","messageID":"msg_0261d7e83001aJ0ZYIWphaSvQ0","sessionID":"ses_fda1daed3ffeZ76o2z0rrfeMgg","type":"text","text":"Go needs 6 extra linkage-only imports — exactly what the by-result-type stubs handle. Building the host validation harness before any QEMU iteration:","time":{"start":1787345885934,"end":1787345894601}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1787345894637,"sessionID":"ses_fda1daed3ffeZ76o2z0rrfeMgg","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_11020b7f8a484a78b6ee2c69","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"/* Host harness: runs a .wasm through the REAL engine + WASI glue + rt\n * (same objects the kernel links) so guest issues surface in seconds,\n * not QEMU-round-trips. */\n#include <cstdio>\n#include <cstdlib>\n#include <cstdint>\n#include <ctime>\n\nvoid console_init(void) {}\nvoid console_putc(char c) { fputc(c, stdout); }\nvoid console_puts(const char *s) { fputs(s, stdout); }\nvoid console_hex64(uint64_t v) { printf(\"0x%llx\", (unsigned long long)v); }\nuint64_t cpu_cycles(void) { return (uint64_t)clock(); }\nvoid cpu_halt(void) { exit(0); }\nuint64_t timer_calibrate_tsc_khz(void) { return 1000000; }\n\n#include \"mm.h\"\nvoid *mm_alloc(uint64_t n, uint64_t align) {\n    if (!align || align < 16)\n        align = 16;\n    return aligned_alloc(align, ((n + align - 1) & ~(align - 1)));\n}\n\nuint32_t timer_calibrate_tsc_khz_public();\n\nint main(int argc, char **argv) {\n    if (argc != 2) {\n        fprintf(stderr, \"usage: hosteng app.wasm\\n\");\n        return 2;\n    }\n    FILE *f = fopen(argv[1], \"rb\");\n    if (!f) {\n        perror(\"open\");\n        return 2;\n    }\n    fseek(f, 0, SEEK_END);\n    long len = ftell(f);\n    fseek(f, 0, SEEK_SET);\n    uint8_t *blob = (uint8_t *)malloc(len);\n    if (fread(blob, 1, len, f) != (size_t)len)\n        return 2;\n    fclose(f);\n\n    extern void wasi_calibrate_clock(uint64_t);\n    wasi_calibrate_clock(timer_calibrate_tsc_khz());\n\n    extern int sched_spawn(const uint8_t *, uint64_t, const char *const *,\n                           int);\n    extern void sched_init(void);\n    sched_init();\n    return sched_spawn(blob, len, 0, 0);\n}\n","filePath":"/home/cyr/kernel/tools/hosteng.cc"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/home/cyr/kernel/tools/hosteng.cc","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"tools/hosteng.cc","time":{"start":1787345894596,"end":1787345894632}},"id":"prt_0261dfcab001kwLBLPkZxS7wsF","sessionID":"ses_fda1daed3ffeZ76o2z0rrfeMgg","messageID":"msg_0261d7e83001aJ0ZYIWphaSvQ0"}}
