{"type":"text","timestamp":1787351243697,"sessionID":"ses_fda1daed3ffeZ76o2z0rrfeMgg","part":{"id":"prt_0266f7e2b0016L7YNuxJu9Tl4V","messageID":"msg_0266d17dd001r79jYQ13gV5bn2","sessionID":"ses_fda1daed3ffeZ76o2z0rrfeMgg","type":"text","text":"Phase 3 committed. Starting **Phase 4**: message ports (ABI §1), kernel-owned §7 endpoints, real cooperative scheduling (native-stack coroutines so wasm servers can interleave), console/login servers, and the three-part gate. Key design: `sched_yield` becomes a true context switch via an arch shim.","time":{"start":1787351236139,"end":1787351243694}}}
